.github_token
.DS_Store

# Google service-account keys. The one that prompted this rule was named after
# its project, so it was listed by hand and the next one would not have been.
# Match the shape instead.
mobile/shareall-2c4e6-354b8a9822d3.json
service-account*.json
*-service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
gha-creds-*.json

# Signing material and the Firebase/Play files that carry it.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
# These two are the public half of Play App Signing — a certificate and the
# public key inside it — and they are tracked on purpose: the assetlinks
# SHA-256 is derived from them. Named so the *.pem rule above cannot swallow
# them the next time one is regenerated.
!mobile/android/app/jperg_signing_cert.pem
!mobile/android/app/jperg_public_key.pem
key.properties
!key.properties.example
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Test photos dropped in while working on face search. Written `.image/` twice
# before, which matches a dotted directory that does not exist — the real one
# is image/, and it was 2.6MB of strangers' faces sitting untracked.
image/
